sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant X as Exchange house<br/>(Dubai)
    participant G as RemittanceGateway
    participant P as Rate publisher
    participant O as Compliance officer
    participant B as Beneficiary wallet<br/>(Cumilla)

    P->>G: publishRate(AE-BD, 33.3243)
    Note over X: Collects AED 1,000 from the sender
    X->>G: tBDT + instruction (beneficiary, AED 1,000, quoted rate, purpose, reference)
    G->>G: originator authorised, rate inside the band,<br/>amount matches, reference not used
    alt at or below the screening threshold
        G->>B: 33,324.30 principal + 833.10 incentive
    else above the screening threshold
        G-->>O: held for review
        alt released
            O->>G: release
            G->>B: principal + incentive
        else rejected, or review window elapsed
            O->>G: reject(reason)
            G->>X: principal returned
        end
    end
